Alembic migrations for TripPilot CRM.

The DB URL and target metadata are loaded from the app (see env.py):
  URL      -> app.core.config.settings.DATABASE_URL
  metadata -> app.core.database.Base.metadata (via `import app.models`)

Common commands (run from the backend/ directory):

  # create a new migration after changing a model
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

  # apply migrations
  alembic upgrade head

  # roll back one migration
  alembic downgrade -1

  # show current DB revision / history
  alembic current
  alembic history

In production (Render) `alembic upgrade head` runs automatically before the
app starts (see backend/Dockerfile).
